<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Aug CPI rises 0.5 pct mo/mo, 5.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovak Aug CPI rises 0.5 pct mo/mo, 5.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovak consumer prices rose 0.5 percent in August, putting prices 5.6 percent higher than August 1995, the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> SLOVAK CONSUMER INFLATION  Aug '96    July '96    Aug '95</p>
<p>  pct change mo/mo	     0.5	   0.3	  0.5</p>
<p>  pct change yr/yr	     5.6	   5.5	  9.8</p>
<p>Details of Slovak August inflation:</p>
<p>Foodstuffs</p>
<p>  pct change month/month     0.5	   0.6	  1.0</p>
<p>  pct change year/year	 4.1	   4.7	 11.0</p>
<p>Non-food items</p>
<p>  pct change month/month     0.5	   0.1	  0.4</p>
<p>  pct change year/year	 6.7	   6.5	  8.5</p>
<p>Public catering</p>
<p>  pct change month/month     0.3	   0.3	  0.4</p>
<p>  pct change year/year	 5.5	   5.6	 12.3</p>
<p>Services</p>
<p>  pct change month/month     1.0	   0.2	  0.1</p>
<p>  pct change year/year	 4.6	   3.7	 10.6</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-210-3688</p>
</text>
